# Optional: if you don't want to commit raw data (recommended for GitHub)
# Remove the lines above and uncomment below if you prefer to track only code
# data/raw/*.csv
# data/processed/
# figures/

# But keep the folder structure so Git tracks the directories
!data/
!data/raw/
!data/processed/
!figures/

# Project-specific generated files
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
*.json   # stats.json is generated

# But keep requirements and README
!requirements.txt
!README.md
!.gitignore

